\textbf{Diff.\ XCorr}& $\mathbf{+0.007}$ & $\mathbf{-0.306}$ & $\mathbf{-0.299}$ \\
Threshold ($3\sigma$) & $+0.111$ & $-0.027$ & $+0.084$ \\
Perm.\ Granger       & $+0.039$ & $-0.180$ & $-0.141$ \\
